<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wednesday's spot rupee rates in the kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.35		 41.40</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	69.60		 69.70</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 23.45		 23.50</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.365		 0.367</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.01		 11.03</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.26		 11.28</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.09		  1.11</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 2.25 pct	    2.45 pct</p>
</text>
